WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:06.260
This one is about colour.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.937
Here is a booking card,
in soft pastel colours.

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.959
At your desk, it looks lovely.

4
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.600
Outside, in the sun, the words disappear.

5
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.650
The person who picked
the colour can always read it.

6
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:25.960
That is the trap.

7
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.840
And 1 man in 12 cannot
tell red from green.

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.650
Here, every pair of colours is checked,
and the weak ones are fixed.

9
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.320
Same blue, same grey.
Just deep enough to read.

10
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:49.519
The secret: colour blindness takes
away hue, but never lightness.

11
00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:54.262
So the fix only moves lightness,
and your brand stays your brand.

12
00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.440
Here is one chart,
seen through 4 kinds of eyes.

13
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.000
The colours change. The bars stay apart.

14
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

15
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
